{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"混合检索(Hybrid Search)原理与实现\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\n什么是混合检索（Hybrid Search）？它解决了纯向量检索的什么问题？请详细描述其工作原理和结果融合方法（如 RRF）。\n\n## 答案\n\n**混合检索**是结合**向量语义检索**和**关键词检索（如 BM25）**的检索策略。它同时利用语义相似度和关键词精确匹配，弥补单一检索方式的不足。\n\n**为什么需要混合检索：**\n\n| 检索方式 | 优势 | 劣势 |\n|---------|------|------|\n| 纯向量检索 | 理解语义相似性，泛化能力强 | 对精确匹配（如ID、代码、专有名词）效果差 |\n| 纯关键词检索(BM25) | 精确匹配能力强，可解释性好 | 无法理解语义，对同义词/近义词无效 |\n\n混合检索将两者结合，**既保留语义理解能力，又确保精确匹配效果**。\n\n**工作原理：**\n\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">用户查询: \"iPhone 15 Pro 电池容量\"<br>\n│<br>\n├──▶ 向量检索通道 ──▶ [文档A(iPhone15评测), 文档B(手机续航对比), ...]<br>\n│                        （语义相似：找到\"手机电池\"相关内容）<br>\n│<br>\n└──▶ 关键词检索通道 ──▶ [文档C(iPhone15 Pro规格), 文档D(苹果产品参数), ...]<br>\n（精确匹配：找到含\"iPhone 15 Pro\"关键词的内容）<br>\n│<br>\n▼<br>\n结果融合（RRF/加权）<br>\n│<br>\n▼<br>\n最终排序结果: [文档C, 文档A, 文档B, 文档D, ...]</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n**结果融合方法：**\n\n**1. RRF（Reciprocal Rank Fusion，倒数排名融合）**\n\nRRF 是目前最主流的融合方法，核心公式：\n\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Score(d) = Σ(1 / (k + rank_i(d)))</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">k 为常数，通常取 60（经验值）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">rank_i(d) 为文档 d 在第 i 个召回通道中的排名</li>\n</ul>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n```python\ndef rrf_fusion(rankings, k=60):\n    \"\"\"\n    多路召回结果融合\n    rankings: [[doc_id1, doc_id2, ...], [doc_id1, doc_id3, ...]]\n    \"\"\"\n    scores = {}\n    for ranking in rankings:\n        for rank, doc_id in enumerate(ranking):\n            if doc_id not in scores:\n                scores[doc_id] = 0\n            scores[doc_id] += 1 / (k + rank)\n    \n    # 按分数降序排列\n    return sorted(scores.items(), key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)\n\n# 示例\nvector_results = [\"doc_C\", \"doc_A\", \"doc_B\"]  # 向量检索结果\nkeyword_results = [\"doc_C\", \"doc_D\", \"doc_A\"]  # 关键词检索结果\n\nfinal_results = rrf_fusion([vector_results, keyword_results])\nprint(final_results)\n# [('doc_C', 0.0328), ('doc_A', 0.0279), ('doc_D', 0.0164), ('doc_B', 0.0164)]\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 线性加权融合</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Score = α × BM25_score + (1-α) × vector_score\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">其中 α 为权重参数（通常 0.3-0.6），需根据业务调优。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>混合检索的优势：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>互补性强</strong>：向量检索覆盖语义相似内容，关键词检索覆盖精确匹配</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>鲁棒性好</strong>：某一路召回失效时，另一路仍可兜底</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>无需调参</strong>：RRF 融合不需要调参，工程实现简单</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>生产环境推荐链路：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">多路召回（BM25 + 向量检索）\n    │\n    ▼\nRRF 融合\n    │\n    ▼\nReranker 精排（如 BGE-Reranker）\n    │\n    ▼\nTop-K 送入 LLM 生成\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: RRF 中 k=60 是怎么来的？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: k=60 是业界经过大量实验验证的经验值。k 的作用是平滑排名差异，防止排名靠前的文档得分差异过大。k 越大，排名差异的影响越小；k 越小，高排名的优势越明显。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 如果某一路召回完全没有相关结果，RRF 怎么处理？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: RRF 天然具有鲁棒性——如果某一路没有召回某文档，该文档在该路上的贡献为 0，但其他路的得分仍然有效。这也是为什么推荐多路召回 + RRF 的原因。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>混合检索就是简单加权</strong> — RRF 不依赖原始分数，只依赖排名，更加鲁棒</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>融合路数越多越好</strong> — 路数过多会增加复杂度和延迟，通常 2-3 路最佳</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>忽略融合后的重排序</strong> — RRF 融合后建议加一层 Reranker 精排</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q7: Rerank 重排序技术是什么？为什么需要它？\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q7: Rerank 重排序技术是什么？为什么需要它？</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}